window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-073-57855da385f5a2bb.json"]={sha256:"57855da385f5a2bb516c1c058ee9d9ee629aa3684081bc9cdea9e22fb690cf2a",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-4814c903b28ffdd6","url":"https://plaso.readthedocs.io/en/latest/sources/user/Using-log2timeline.html","title":"Plaso analysis and processing documentation","titleEn":"Plaso analysis and processing documentation","publisher":"Plaso","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-073","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-073","related":[{"id":"security-v27-074","referenceUrls":["https://timesketch.org/guides/user/search-query-guide/"],"title":"Timesketch：保存查詢版本與反證可重現性","titleEn":"Timesketch: versioned searches and reproducible counterevidence","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：提交source-ledger.csv、parser-manifest.json、run-arguments.txt、errors.json與coverage-diff.md；每個改善要指出對應來源ID。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver source-ledger.csv, parser-manifest.json, run-arguments.txt, errors.json and coverage-diff.md. Every claimed improvement must name the source IDs it actually recovered and the remaining scope limitations.","difference":"建立包含查詢、選取時間線ID、時間範圍、欄位與匯入雜湊的搜尋規格；分開列出命中列數與原始事件唯一數。","differenceEn":"Create a search specification containing query, selected timeline IDs, time bounds, fields and import hashes. Report matching rows separately from unique original events so collaborators can reproduce the exact scope.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["log2timeline擷取事件、pinfo與psort處理儲存與輸出；一個來源可產生多事件，所以檔案覆蓋與事件數是不同指標。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 來源100個，80成功、12未支援、8失敗；成功來源產生4000事件。指定工具版本、解析器清單及每次執行的獨立輸出名稱。 已成功擷取的來源覆蓋為80/100=80%；平均每個成功來源50事件不能用來推論其餘20個來源的內容。","Timesketch的儲存搜尋與時間線協助重現分析；來源重複匯入不會製造第二個現實事件，事件身份應由明確來源鍵建立。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 A有40個命中事件，B有30個，其中10個與A同源；再匯入A副本40列。原始身份由source_id加record_offset組成。 原始命中列70，唯一事件40+30−10=60；加入A副本後110列但仍60個唯一事件。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["log2timeline extracts events while pinfo and psort support storage inspection and output. One source can produce many events, so file coverage and extracted event count must be reported separately. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. There are 100 source files: 80 successful, 12 unsupported and eight failed, producing 4,000 events from successful inputs. Pin tool version, parser list and a separate output name for every run. Successful source coverage is 80/100=80%. The average of 50 events per successful source gives no evidence about the content of the other twenty sources.","Timesketch saved searches and timelines support reproducible analysis. Importing a source twice does not create another real-world event; define identity with explicit source keys rather than row position. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Timeline A has forty matching events; B has thirty, ten sharing identities with A. A duplicate import adds forty rows. Define original identity as source_id plus record_offset. The initial result has seventy rows and 40+30−10=60 unique events. Adding the duplicate A import increases rows to 110 while the unique-event total remains sixty.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-083","referenceUrls":["https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/cluster-administration/flow-control/"],"title":"Kubernetes API Priority and Fairness：座位預算與請求成本","titleEn":"Kubernetes API Priority and Fairness: seat budgets and request cost","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：提交source-ledger.csv、parser-manifest.json、run-arguments.txt、errors.json與coverage-diff.md；每個改善要指出對應來源ID。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver source-ledger.csv, parser-manifest.json, run-arguments.txt, errors.json and coverage-diff.md. Every claimed improvement must name the source IDs it actually recovered and the remaining scope limitations.","difference":"用合成座位預算比較兩個優先等級，保留請求成本與占用時間；建立明確簡化模型，不宣稱重現Kubernetes完整排程演算法。","differenceEn":"Compare two priority levels using a synthetic seat budget, preserving request cost and occupancy duration. State the simplified model explicitly rather than claiming to reproduce the complete Kubernetes scheduling algorithm.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["log2timeline擷取事件、pinfo與psort處理儲存與輸出；一個來源可產生多事件，所以檔案覆蓋與事件數是不同指標。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 來源100個，80成功、12未支援、8失敗；成功來源產生4000事件。指定工具版本、解析器清單及每次執行的獨立輸出名稱。 已成功擷取的來源覆蓋為80/100=80%；平均每個成功來源50事件不能用來推論其餘20個來源的內容。","APF以流程及優先等級管理API併發與公平性；本例固定無借用、總60座位、權重2比1，僅用比例計算名義分配。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 等級A權重2分40座位，B權重1分20；A每請求占4座位，B每請求占1，所有工作期間相同且無其他限制。 A同時可放40/4=10請求，B可放20/1=20；A座位較多仍可同時服務較少請求。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["log2timeline extracts events while pinfo and psort support storage inspection and output. One source can produce many events, so file coverage and extracted event count must be reported separately. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. There are 100 source files: 80 successful, 12 unsupported and eight failed, producing 4,000 events from successful inputs. Pin tool version, parser list and a separate output name for every run. Successful source coverage is 80/100=80%. The average of 50 events per successful source gives no evidence about the content of the other twenty sources.","APF manages API concurrency through flows and priority levels. The fixture fixes sixty seats, disables borrowing and assumes a two-to-one share ratio solely to calculate an illustrative nominal allocation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Level A receives forty seats from weight two, while B receives twenty from weight one. Each A request consumes four seats and each B request one; durations are equal with no additional constraints. A can admit 40/4=10 simultaneous requests, whereas B can admit 20/1=20. More seats therefore need not mean a larger count of concurrent requests when costs differ.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-8979d91463d9c2d6","url":"https://timesketch.org/guides/user/search-query-guide/","title":"Timesketch developer documentation","titleEn":"Timesketch developer documentation","publisher":"Timesketch","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-f768a3e8948ad48c","url":"https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/cluster-administration/flow-control/","title":"Kubernetes API Priority and Fairness","titleEn":"Kubernetes API Priority and Fairness","publisher":"Kubernetes","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
